#: ../../../install_osx.md:1
msgid "Binary Installation on macOS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:3
msgid ""
"Pre-built Harmonic binaries (bottles) are available for macOS Sequoia on "
"Apple Silicon (arm64) using the [Homebrew package manager](https://"
"brew.sh/). On other macOS versions Homebrew builds the packages from source, "
"which can take a long time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:8
msgid "After installing Homebrew, Gazebo Harmonic can be installed running:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:10
msgid ""
"brew tap osrf/simulation\n"
"brew trust osrf/simulation\n"
"brew install gz-harmonic\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:16
msgid ""
"All libraries should be ready to use and the `gz sim -s` server app ready to "
"be executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:18
msgid ""
"Head back to the [Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Gazebo!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:21
msgid "Uninstalling binary install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:23
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Gazebo or switch to a source-based install once you "
"have already installed the library from binaries, run the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_osx.md:26
msgid "brew uninstall gz-harmonic\n"
msgstr ""

